{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31078","headline":"许州题观察判官厅 · 薛能","name":"许州题观察判官厅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三载从戎类系匏，重游全许尚分茅。\n刘郎别後无遗履，丁令归来有旧巢。\n冬暖井梧多未落，夜寒窗竹自相敲。\n纤腰弟子知千恨，笑与扬雄作解嘲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}